==Description==
The '''Banned Crate''' is a crate given out to players for triumphing [[Nil Zone]] as part of the [[Halloween 2025 Live Events]] and through [[Null & Void Event]] [[Index#Null & Void|Achievements]]. It was only given out on the first triumph of each live event run and once per specific [[Index#Null & Void|Achievements]].

Currently, it only has six skins.

==Appearance==
The '''Banned Crate''' is a metal purple crate with a keypad, which is used to open it.

