==Trivia==
*It was stated there would be five skins total through the global chat messages during the [[Halloween 2025 Live Events]]<ref>[[File:BannedSkincrate5Skins.png|280px]]</ref>, though this appears to have been either scrapped or a typo.
*The appearance of the '''Banned Crate''' is a retextured version of the [[Cold Front Crate]].
*The crate is opened by entering the code "''1337''" into the keypad, which is a reference to [[wp:Leet|leetspeak]].

